{"id":"b840baceecaade77","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-logic9-truth-predicate.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Truth Predicate","display":"df-zfc-logic9-truth-predicate — ZFC Logic9 Truth Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-truth-predicate","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-truth-predicate"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-truth-predicate — ZFC Logic9 Truth Predicate","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-truth-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-truth-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-truth-predicate — ZFC Logic9 Truth Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula\">../batch17/58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure\">../batch18/58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment\">../batch03/58-df-assignment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V\">\\(T,M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V\\)</span> (truth set, set-coded structure, language, recursive semantic maps, and assignment)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span> (formula set), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_L\\)</span> (free-variable operator), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> (assignment predicate), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span> (recursive satisfaction predicate) are as in the dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9TruthPredicate}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9TruthPredicate}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9TruthPredicate}_S(T,M,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;\\land T=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L):\n\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9TruthPredicate}_S(T,M,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;\\land T=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L):\n\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The predicate is the complete first-order theory of the specified set-coded structure.  Sentences are selected by the canonical free-variable operator, and truth is evaluated by one recursively certified satisfaction map over every assignment.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9TruthPredicate}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9TruthPredicate}_S(T,M,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&\\land T=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L):\n\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1657,"backlinks":[{"id":"c6d62f4a383b91b0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9TruthPredicate}_S\\subseteq V^3$ is from [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-logic9-truth-predicate]]."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2503","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-logic9-truth-predicate.md|58-df-zfc-logic9-truth-predicate]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093","8b6a90316aad78a4","d9b8711cda3f31ca","715a32e91161b34f","64f35ba2e87964e0"]}